              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.24+2KI.17.25+2KI.17.26+2KI.17.27+2KI.17.28+2KI.17.29+2KI.17.30+2KI.17.31+2KI.17.32+2KI.17.33+2KI.17.34+2KI.17.35+2KI.17.36+2KI.17.37+2KI.17.38+2KI.17.39+2KI.17.40+2KI.17.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Afalume 17:24–41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amlunga Zerubabeli na nyo vilongozi a nyumba za akare aho achiaambira, “Hupheni ruhusa hudzenge phamwenga namwi, mana hunaabudu ye Mlungu wenu dza mwimwi, naswi kala huchimlavira sadaka hangu siku Esarihadoni, mfalume wa Ashuru ariphohureha hipha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Zerubabeli, Jeshuwa na hara vilongozi anjina a nyumba za akare aho hiko Iziraeli achiaambira, “Mwimwi tamfwaha kushirikiana naswi kudzengera Mlungu wehu, hundamdzengera Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli swiswi enye, kama Koreshi mfalume wa Pashia arivyohulagiza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
