              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara tu baruwa ihi ya mfalume Aritashasita iriphosomwa, Rehumu, Shimushai na ayawao anjina auka mara mwenga hadi Jerusalemu achenda ashurutisha na kualazimisha Ayahudi ariche kudzenga.",
          "type": "text",
